    "Route133_Text_MollieDefeat": "I may have lost thousands of times,\\nbut a loss still stings.$",
    "Route133_Text_MolliePostBattle": "Keep at this, youngster. So you can\\nbecome like my husband and me.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
